   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2021 CHUNHUI CHILDREN&apos;S FOUNDATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shanghai Chunhui Care Home partners along with children&#x2019;s welfare institutions in China will bring orphaned infants and toddlers born with life-threatening diseases and birth defects to Shanghai to provide them with the best medical care available. Working with the institutions and Shanghai&#x2019;s top hospitals, Shanghai Chunhui Care Home covers all areas of the children&#x2019;s medical treatment including pre-operative check, hospitalization, surgery and other care. This project will focus specifically on Shanghai and the Eastern China region.</narrative>
  </description>
